  "duration_s": 239.072993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "小王啊，你个子是真高比，我还高一头呢。个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？我得留着量，万一您喝到位了，总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吗？鱼好，鱼鱼惜惜是刺多。领导，您看虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。我看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，那是因为沾了领导，您的光跟着您干事儿，气色当然不会差了，今天让你破费了。领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教。不是，哎呀，我都老了不中用了。哎，领导，您可千万别这么说，我们论能力、论经验论、资历都不如您这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还不够沉稳，还要向您多学习，我们才能变得更优秀哈。乔，你最近表现的不错啊，看来我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听您的意思，领导也是高升了呀，我也提前敬领导一杯。哈哈哈哈哈小王，你这菜点的太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾，多这杯酒先敬您。哈哈哈哈哈你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，穿着舒服，跟您共事久了，人也实在了不讲究那些虚的。哈哈哈哈哈，和你这么漂亮的女孩的吃饭，不用喝就已经醉了。领导，您真幽默，您还没沾酒就让我沾光了。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你今天话怎么这么少？再听您说，酒桌上您讲东西比开会时还有料，我舍不得打断你我怎么你这一入职，我刚种的花儿就死了，花开富贵嘛，花开过了就剩富贵了。看来领导您啊要发大财了。哈哈哈哈，怎么菜还没上齐，你就结账了，先结账是表明态度，这顿饭我请定了，后面再加菜。您随便点，没有心理负担，吃的才尽兴。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。青岛美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，小王站我旁边，不怕把你照老了，站您旁边哪会显老，只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对。哈哈哈哈哈梨我就先收下了，但事儿能不能办成，我可不敢打包票啊。领导，您说笑了，这事儿能成是您的加持，不能成的话就是我的造化，无论结果如何，都得感谢。领导您的提携啊，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本对答如流，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，会说话，会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本对答如流，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，每天看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，真是让我欲解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的，这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 830,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1250,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2850,
      "end_ms": 3930,
      "text": "我还高一头呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4350,
      "end_ms": 8370,
      "text": "个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10170,
      "end_ms": 12830,
      "text": "你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12830,
      "end_ms": 13730,
      "text": "我得留着量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13730,
      "end_ms": 14750,
      "text": "万一您喝到位了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14750,
      "end_ms": 20170,
      "text": "总得有个清醒的人负责掏您家门钥匙吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20190,
      "end_ms": 20670,
      "text": "鱼好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00010",
      "start_ms": 20670,
      "end_ms": 22830,
      "text": "鱼鱼惜惜是刺多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23470,
      "end_ms": 23810,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00012",
      "start_ms": 23810,
      "end_ms": 25350,
      "text": "您看虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25490,
      "end_ms": 29035,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30310,
      "end_ms": 33950,
      "text": "我看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34290,
      "end_ms": 35310,
      "text": "那是因为沾了领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35310,
      "end_ms": 36870,
      "text": "您的光跟着您干事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36870,
      "end_ms": 38225,
      "text": "气色当然不会差了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00018",
      "start_ms": 40310,
      "end_ms": 41450,
      "text": "今天让你破费了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41750,
      "end_ms": 42170,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42350,
      "end_ms": 43790,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43790,
      "end_ms": 44570,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45030,
      "end_ms": 46650,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46650,
      "end_ms": 47010,
      "text": "不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00024",
      "start_ms": 48810,
      "end_ms": 49290,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00025",
      "start_ms": 49590,
      "end_ms": 51570,
      "text": "我都老了不中用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00026",
      "start_ms": 51730,
      "end_ms": 51970,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00027",
      "start_ms": 52010,
      "end_ms": 52350,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52350,
      "end_ms": 53410,
      "text": "您可千万别这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00029",
      "start_ms": 53570,
      "end_ms": 57950,
      "text": "我们论能力、论经验论、资历都不如您这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00030",
      "start_ms": 59010,
      "end_ms": 60315,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00031",
      "start_ms": 61260,
      "end_ms": 62775,
      "text": "年轻就是还不够沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00032",
      "start_ms": 63290,
      "end_ms": 64405,
      "text": "还要向您多学习，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00033",
      "start_ms": 64670,
      "end_ms": 67840,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00034",
      "start_ms": 68480,
      "end_ms": 68700,
      "text": "乔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00035",
      "start_ms": 68700,
      "end_ms": 70285,
      "text": "你最近表现的不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00036",
      "start_ms": 70620,
      "end_ms": 72800,
      "text": "看来我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00037",
      "start_ms": 72880,
      "end_ms": 74140,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00038",
      "start_ms": 74300,
      "end_ms": 75040,
      "text": "听您的意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00039",
      "start_ms": 75040,
      "end_ms": 76060,
      "text": "领导也是高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00040",
      "start_ms": 76060,
      "end_ms": 77235,
      "text": "我也提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77510,
      "end_ms": 79060,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79420,
      "end_ms": 80975,
      "text": "你这菜点的太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00043",
      "start_ms": 81540,
      "end_ms": 83250,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00044",
      "start_ms": 83290,
      "end_ms": 84870,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00045",
      "start_ms": 84870,
      "end_ms": 86260,
      "text": "多这杯酒先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00046",
      "start_ms": 86500,
      "end_ms": 90405,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00047",
      "start_ms": 91430,
      "end_ms": 92255,
      "text": "穿着舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00048",
      "start_ms": 92670,
      "end_ms": 93530,
      "text": "跟您共事久了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00049",
      "start_ms": 93530,
      "end_ms": 95585,
      "text": "人也实在了不讲究那些虚的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00050",
      "start_ms": 96730,
      "end_ms": 97565,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00051",
      "start_ms": 98300,
      "end_ms": 100140,
      "text": "和你这么漂亮的女孩的吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00052",
      "start_ms": 100400,
      "end_ms": 101975,
      "text": "不用喝就已经醉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00053",
      "start_ms": 102380,
      "end_ms": 102800,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00054",
      "start_ms": 103040,
      "end_ms": 103835,
      "text": "您真幽默，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00055",
      "start_ms": 104180,
      "end_ms": 105865,
      "text": "您还没沾酒就让我沾光了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00056",
      "start_ms": 106290,
      "end_ms": 107690,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00057",
      "start_ms": 108420,
      "end_ms": 109665,
      "text": "你今天话怎么这么少？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00058",
      "start_ms": 109980,
      "end_ms": 110640,
      "text": "再听您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00059",
      "start_ms": 110880,
      "end_ms": 113155,
      "text": "酒桌上您讲东西比开会时还有料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00060",
      "start_ms": 113360,
      "end_ms": 117875,
      "text": "我舍不得打断你我怎么你这一入职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00061",
      "start_ms": 118220,
      "end_ms": 119840,
      "text": "我刚种的花儿就死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00062",
      "start_ms": 120000,
      "end_ms": 120960,
      "text": "花开富贵嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00063",
      "start_ms": 120980,
      "end_ms": 122580,
      "text": "花开过了就剩富贵了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00064",
      "start_ms": 122640,
      "end_ms": 124420,
      "text": "看来领导您啊要发大财了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00065",
      "start_ms": 125540,
      "end_ms": 126355,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00066",
      "start_ms": 126710,
      "end_ms": 127850,
      "text": "怎么菜还没上齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00067",
      "start_ms": 127850,
      "end_ms": 128665,
      "text": "你就结账了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00068",
      "start_ms": 129150,
      "end_ms": 130605,
      "text": "先结账是表明态度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00069",
      "start_ms": 130830,
      "end_ms": 131845,
      "text": "这顿饭我请定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00070",
      "start_ms": 132090,
      "end_ms": 132810,
      "text": "后面再加菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00071",
      "start_ms": 132810,
      "end_ms": 133490,
      "text": "您随便点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00072",
      "start_ms": 133590,
      "end_ms": 134430,
      "text": "没有心理负担，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00073",
      "start_ms": 134450,
      "end_ms": 135190,
      "text": "吃的才尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00074",
      "start_ms": 136490,
      "end_ms": 136825,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00075",
      "start_ms": 137120,
      "end_ms": 137885,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00076",
      "start_ms": 138100,
      "end_ms": 139520,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00077",
      "start_ms": 139620,
      "end_ms": 141140,
      "text": "青岛美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00078",
      "start_ms": 141180,
      "end_ms": 142200,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00079",
      "start_ms": 142280,
      "end_ms": 144285,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00080",
      "start_ms": 144600,
      "end_ms": 146125,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00081",
      "start_ms": 146730,
      "end_ms": 147995,
      "text": "小王站我旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00082",
      "start_ms": 148320,
      "end_ms": 149395,
      "text": "不怕把你照老了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00083",
      "start_ms": 149890,
      "end_ms": 151255,
      "text": "站您旁边哪会显老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00084",
      "start_ms": 151590,
      "end_ms": 153515,
      "text": "只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00085",
      "start_ms": 154060,
      "end_ms": 156575,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈梨我就先收下了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00086",
      "start_ms": 156780,
      "end_ms": 157760,
      "text": "但事儿能不能办成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00087",
      "start_ms": 157760,
      "end_ms": 158900,
      "text": "我可不敢打包票啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00088",
      "start_ms": 158900,
      "end_ms": 159100,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00089",
      "start_ms": 159100,
      "end_ms": 159815,
      "text": "您说笑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00090",
      "start_ms": 160040,
      "end_ms": 161320,
      "text": "这事儿能成是您的加持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00091",
      "start_ms": 161320,
      "end_ms": 162600,
      "text": "不能成的话就是我的造化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00092",
      "start_ms": 162680,
      "end_ms": 163500,
      "text": "无论结果如何，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00093",
      "start_ms": 163500,
      "end_ms": 164040,
      "text": "都得感谢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00094",
      "start_ms": 164040,
      "end_ms": 165335,
      "text": "领导您的提携啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00095",
      "start_ms": 165970,
      "end_ms": 167725,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00096",
      "start_ms": 167930,
      "end_ms": 168885,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00097",
      "start_ms": 169280,
      "end_ms": 171735,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本对答如流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00098",
      "start_ms": 172110,
      "end_ms": 174130,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00099",
      "start_ms": 174130,
      "end_ms": 174710,
      "text": "会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00100",
      "start_ms": 174810,
      "end_ms": 175790,
      "text": "会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00101",
      "start_ms": 175930,
      "end_ms": 177090,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00102",
      "start_ms": 177170,
      "end_ms": 177870,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00103",
      "start_ms": 177970,
      "end_ms": 179070,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00104",
      "start_ms": 179250,
      "end_ms": 181030,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本对答如流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00105",
      "start_ms": 181290,
      "end_ms": 183290,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00106",
      "start_ms": 183530,
      "end_ms": 184430,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00107",
      "start_ms": 184550,
      "end_ms": 185925,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00108",
      "start_ms": 186190,
      "end_ms": 189075,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00109",
      "start_ms": 189500,
      "end_ms": 190840,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00110",
      "start_ms": 190900,
      "end_ms": 191895,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00111",
      "start_ms": 192350,
      "end_ms": 192490,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00112",
      "start_ms": 192490,
      "end_ms": 194910,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00113",
      "start_ms": 195130,
      "end_ms": 195810,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00114",
      "start_ms": 196090,
      "end_ms": 197230,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00115",
      "start_ms": 197390,
      "end_ms": 198855,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00116",
      "start_ms": 199400,
      "end_ms": 201135,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00117",
      "start_ms": 201430,
      "end_ms": 203370,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00118",
      "start_ms": 203630,
      "end_ms": 204650,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00119",
      "start_ms": 204770,
      "end_ms": 207860,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00120",
      "start_ms": 207900,
      "end_ms": 209160,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00121",
      "start_ms": 209340,
      "end_ms": 210815,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00122",
      "start_ms": 211130,
      "end_ms": 212585,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00123",
      "start_ms": 213010,
      "end_ms": 214530,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00124",
      "start_ms": 214710,
      "end_ms": 215950,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00125",
      "start_ms": 215950,
      "end_ms": 217730,
      "text": "真是让我欲解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00126",
      "start_ms": 217890,
      "end_ms": 219295,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00127",
      "start_ms": 219730,
      "end_ms": 222950,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同场景之下应该怎么说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00128",
      "start_ms": 223270,
      "end_ms": 226385,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00129",
      "start_ms": 226750,
      "end_ms": 228195,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00130",
      "start_ms": 228620,
      "end_ms": 230255,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00131",
      "start_ms": 230680,
      "end_ms": 233000,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00132",
      "start_ms": 233240,
      "end_ms": 234420,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00133",
      "start_ms": 234600,
      "end_ms": 236980,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d8a71a2f9cff7170_s00134",
      "start_ms": 237020,
      "end_ms": 238815,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
